### Create scan
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "nginx:1.25",
  "options": {
    "ignoreUnfixed": true,
    "timeoutSec": 120
  }
}

### After you get scanId, fetch normalized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scans/dba983cf-3569-4b51-a318-8b1076c82fb6

### Fetch raw Trivy JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scans/dba983cf-3569-4b51-a318-8b1076c82fb6?raw=true